    <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Preparar l&amp;iacute;nea, envasar, cerrar, marcar, etiquetar, controlar calidad y transferir lote.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
